Add yamusic-tui-git: terminal user interface for the YAMusic music server

Builds github.com/DECE2183/yamusic-tui from a pinned commit; upstream
has no releases, hence the -git suffix.  Browses, searches and plays
Yandex Music tracks with lyrics display, caching and playlist
management.  On NetBSD audio playback is routed from ALSA to OSS via
alsa-plugins-oss (see share/doc/yamusic-tui/README).
